{"agent":"recover-5g","data":{"by":"grok-4.7","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":2,"detail":"`attest` treats a question as multiple-choice with `if row[\"options\"]:` while `payload` and `verify` use `row.get(\"options\")`. A waiting free-text question whose row omits the `options` key (the shape `payload` already accepts: `opts = row.get(\"options\") or []`, then no `options` in the tool input) raises `KeyError` before `E.answer`, so the harness channel still cannot record the typed reply. `verify` would have taken the free-text branch (`h.answer == row.get(\"answer\")`) for that same row.","digest":"d47eee90c7b681bc","family":"xai","location":"ddflow/services/approvals/harness.py:487","reviewer":"grok-4.7","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/services/approvals/harness.py:487"}],"chunks_total":5,"coverage":"3/5 chunk(s) reviewed, 1 off-contract","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":24933,"diff_sha":"86bf54d66f3fcc948aaf26f59f23f370c597b3f37cc7d194953cf9d4bc9d0628","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in $HOME/src/ddflow/.ddflow/worktrees/fix-B-question-ask-unreachable","diff_stat":{"deletions":1,"files":2,"insertions":46,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":55.0,"family":"xai","findings":1,"max_chunk_chars":8000,"model":"grok-4.7","output_digest":"a9962e07da3d94ac","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/fix-B-question-ask-unreachable.critic.grok-4.7.20261109T060301Z-741ef6b8.jsonl","reason":"2 of 5 chunk(s) not reviewed:\n  chunk 1/5 (ddflow/api/approvals.py, ddflow/api/approvals_answer.py, ddflow/api/approvals_harness.py, ddflow/api/reporting/overview.py): came back OFF CONTRACT: 116 chars with no STATUS: block. Not counted as reviewed.\n  chunk 3/5 (ddflow/services/approvals/view.py): HTTP 429: {\"code\":\"resource-exhausted\",\"error\":\"The model is currently at capacity due to high demand. Please try again in a few minutes, or use a higher service tier for priority processing: https://docs.x.ai/developers/advanced-api-usage/priority-processing\"}","review